OL,3,GNEWSAFailings contributed to three
OL,4,Akillings, jury finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of police and healthcare
OL,7,Ffailings contributed to the deaths of
OL,8,Fthree elderly men killed by a man
OL,9,Fsuffering a psychotic episode who was
OL,10,Freleased from custody hours before the
OL,11,Fkillings, a jury has found.
OL,13,FAlexander Lewis-Ranwell, now 35, was
OL,14,Farrested and released twice before he
OL,15,Fkilled Anthony Payne, 80, and twins
OL,16,FRoger and Dick Carter, 84, in Exeter,
OL,17,Fon 10 February 2019.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
