OL,3,GNEWSAFailings contributed to three
OL,4,Akillings, jury finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FInquests heard concerns about his
OL,7,Fmental health were raised, but he was
OL,8,Freleased without a Mental Health Act
OL,9,F(MHA) assessment that could have led to
OL,10,Fhim being sectioned.
OL,12,FSpeaking after the inquests, the Carter
OL,13,Ffamily said there had been "systemic
OL,14,Ffailures and missed opportunities that
OL,15,Fcost them their lives".
